<li>17 April 2000–12 Desember 2001 : Duli Yang Maha Mulia Tuanku Syed Sirajuddin ibni Almarhum Tuanku Syed Putra Jamalullail, Raja Perlis</li>
<li>12 Desember 2001–13 Desember 2006 : Kebawah Duli Yang Maha Mulia Seri Paduka Baginda Tuanku Syed Sirajuddin ibni Almarhum Tuanku Syed Putra Jamalullail, Yang di-Pertuan Agong XII</li>
<li>13 Disember 2006–sekarang : Duli Yang Maha Mulia Tuanku Syed Sirajuddin ibni Almarhum Tuanku Syed Putra Jamalullail, Raja Perlis</li>
</ul>
Gelar kehormatan.
Gelar lengkap Tuanku Syed Sirajuddin adalah Duli Yang Maha Mulia Tuanku Syed Sirajuddin ibni Almarhum Tuanku Syed Putra Jamalullail, D.K.P., D.K., S.S.P.J., D.K.M., D.M.N., D.K. (Perak), D.K (Negeri Sembilan), D.K (Kedah), D.K. (Kelantan), D.K.M.B. (Brunei), D.K. (Selangor), D.K. (Pahang), D.K. II(Terengganu), S.P.M.J., S.P.C.M., S.S.M.T., Grand Order of King Tomislav (Croatia), Grand Collier De L`Independence (Grand Medal of the Independence) - Cambodia, Grand Croix De L`Ordre (Royal Sash) - Cambodia, Cavaliere Di Gran Croce Decorato Di Gran Cordone (Italy), Qiladah Badr Al-Kubra (Arab Saudi), Decoration of Omayad - The Finest Decoration (Syria), Knight of the Royal Order of the Seraphim (Sweden), Grand Cordon of the Order of the Sacred Treasure (Japan), Tuanku Raja Perlis.
